The game takes place in an alternate history in which Winston Churchill dies in 1931, eight years before the start of World War II, presenting the possibility of what could have happened to Europe, the United States, and the rest of the world without his leadership.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/turning-point-fall-of-liberty', '["PlayStation 3", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 5.2, 0, 1.24, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
