VALUES (NULL, NULL, 2113, 'Star Wars Battlefront', 'Star Wars Battlefront', 'game', 2015, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2res.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar4rr.jpg', 'Star Wars Battlefront is a first- and third-person shooter set in the fictional universe of the original Star Wars trilogy, and a reboot of the Battlefront series. Players fight as Rebel Alliance or Imperial soldiers across planets such as Hoth, Endor, and Tatooine, using a mix of infantry combat, ground and air vehicles, and unlockable "hero" characters drawn from the films. The game focuses on multiplayer across a range of objective-based modes, and also includes cooperative and solo missions that can be played offline.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/star-wars-battlefront--1', '["PlayStation 4", "PlayStation VR", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 6.8, 0, 1.02, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
