VALUES (NULL, NULL, 548, 'Gears of War 2', 'Gears of War 2', 'game', 2008, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28gg.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar845.jpg', 'Gears of War 2 is a third-person shooter built around tactical use of cover. Players fight through a campaign as a soldier of the Coalition of Ordered Governments, carrying a limited loadout of weapons and using cover, melee attacks, and the series'' chainsaw bayonet against enemy forces. It supports cooperative campaign play and a range of competitive multiplayer modes, and introduces Horde mode, in which up to five players survive escalating waves of enemies together.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/gears-of-war-2', '["Xbox 360"]', NULL, 8.7, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
