VALUES (NULL, NULL, 26401, 'Star Wars Battlefront II', 'Star Wars Battlefront II', 'game', 2017, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3wi7.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar4rj.jpg', 'Star Wars Battlefront II is a first- and third-person shooter set across all three eras of the Star Wars saga. Players engage in large-scale ground and space battles using class-based soldiers, reinforcements, vehicles, and iconic heroes or villains from the franchise. Multiplayer modes span maps drawn from locations across the films, while a single-player campaign follows an original story set between Return of the Jedi and The Force Awakens. The game launched in 2017 amid a major loot box controversy that led to the removal of microtransactions and a complete overhaul of its progression system, after which it received years of free content updates that substantially expanded its offerings.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/star-wars-battlefront-ii--1', '["PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 7.1, 0, 0.0, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
