VALUES (NULL, NULL, 18918, 'Northgard', 'Northgard', 'game', 2018, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/guqifzispzew1rubnyzd.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar57p.jpg', 'Northgard is a strategy game based on Norse mythology in which you control a clan of Vikings vying for the control of a mysterious newfound continent.

- Build your settlement on the newly discovered continent of Northgard

- Assign your vikings to various jobs (Farmer, Warrior, Sailor, Loremaster...)

- Manage your resources carefully and survive harsh winters and vicious foes

- Expand and discover new territory with unique strategic opportunities

- Achieve different victory conditions (Conquest, Fame, Lore, Trading...)

- Play against your friends or against an AI with different difficulty levels and personalities

- Enjoy dedicated servers and grind the ranks to reach the final Norse God rank!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/northgard', '["PlayStation 4", "Linux", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "Mac", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 7.6, 0, 9.01, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
