Played from a first person perspective and powered by a 3D engine utilising cutting edge technology, Penumbra is a substantial advancement of the genre.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/penumbra-overture', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 7.5, 0, 1.06, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
