VALUES (NULL, NULL, 8581, 'Star Fox', 'Star Fox', 'game', 1993, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co99og.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar2ijg.jpg', 'Star Fox, released as Starwing in Europe, is a 1993 rail shooter video game developed and published by Nintendo, with assistance from Argonaut Software, for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System. The first game in the Star Fox series, Star Fox follows Fox McCloud and the rest of the Star Fox team defending their homeworld of Corneria against the attacking forces of Andross.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/star-fox', '["Super Nintendo Entertainment System", "Super Famicom"]', NULL, 7.6, 0, 8.0, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
