Gladiator manager allows you to control the career of your gladiators in detail, and to construct training facilities, as well as grand monuments! You will be opposed by rival gladiator schools, as well as upstart rebels lead by Spartacus himself!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/gladiator-manager--1', '["Android", "iOS"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 9.01, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
