Dominions is a deep 4x turn based strategy game with a very large variety of spells and units.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/dominions-5', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 8.0, 0, 8.04, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
