VALUES (NULL, NULL, 11050, 'The Last Federation', 'The Last Federation', 'game', 2014, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/coa3kl.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ebo5zuhygq7ecwy5svb8.jpg', 'From the creators of AI War: Fleet Command comes an all-new grand strategy title with turn-based tactical combat, set in a deep simulation of an entire solar system and its billions of inhabitants. You are the last of a murdered race, determined to unify or destroy the 8 others.

As the last remaining Hydral, it is up to you to create a lasting federation of planets and usher in an era of peace and prosperity to the solar system. Bring spacefaring technology to underdeveloped societies, manipulate their economies, political systems, and diplomatic relations. Do whatever it takes to end strife in your solar system. Remember, when helping civilizations evolve, sometimes they evolve faster when a large multi-headed monster is glaring menacingly at them.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/the-last-federation', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 6.0, 0, 10.01, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
