VALUES (NULL, NULL, 260340, 'Dominions 6: Rise of the Pantokrator', 'Dominions 6: Rise of the Pantokrator', 'game', 2024, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7nq6.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar2g3d.jpg', 'In Dominions 6 you take control of a powerful being that rules a nation and aspires to godhood. The type of Pretender Gods can vary from magically powerful arch mages to old dragons or an enormous tree. Dominions is a deep 4x turn based strategy game with a very large variety of spells and units.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/dominions-6-rise-of-the-pantokrator', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 10.01, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
