VALUES (NULL, NULL, 152974, 'Starship Simulator', 'Starship Simulator', 'game', NULL, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4yq3.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar20no.jpg', 'Step aboard a fully-simulated, realistic starship with 200+ rooms over 7 decks.

Explore a 1:1 scale galaxy driven by real astrophysics, in real-time, either solo or with friends.

Starsim has a lot to offer any space game fan, from Captaining a starship, to cooking for the crew. You''ll have many things to repair in engineering and hopefully, not too many injuries in medical!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/starship-simulator', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 1.03, '2026-11-28 04:52:47', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
