VALUES (NULL, NULL, 623, 'Call of Duty 4: Modern Warfare', 'Call of Duty 4: Modern Warfare', 'game', 2007, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wko.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar5j4x.jpg', 'Call of Duty 4: Modern Warfare differs from previous installments of the Call of Duty series. Previous Call of Duty games have a distinct three country-specific campaign style, while Call of Duty 4 has a more film-like plot with interlaced story lines from the perspectives of Sgt. Paul Jackson of the Marines 1st Force Recon and Sgt. ''Soap'' MacTavish of the British 22nd SAS Regiment.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/call-of-duty-4-modern-warfare', '["PlayStation 3", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 8.6, 0, 6.19333333333333335e+00, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
