VALUES (NULL, NULL, 1046, 'Star Control II', 'Star Control II', 'game', 1992, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2d9l.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arr4o.jpg', 'Star Control II, the sequel to the original Star Control, is a space adventure game that features role-playing elements alongside a 2D space ship melee combat system. The player assumes the role of The Captain of a single starship wandering a detailed environment of solar systems, gradually gathering information and resources in order to defeat a mysterious and implacable enemy.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/star-control-ii', '["Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "3DO Interactive Multiplayer", "Mac", "DOS"]', NULL, 9.6, 0, 10.535, '2026-11-21 13:07:40', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
