VALUES (NULL, NULL, 83844, 'Battlefleet Gothic: Armada 2', 'Battlefleet Gothic: Armada 2', 'game', 2019, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2piz.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ak91e4mdt3sohayiypsr.jpg', 'Greatly expanding on the groundwork laid out by the first game, Battlefleet Gothic: Armada 2 is a full-blown sequel: bigger, richer, and more ambitious than the original game. At launch, it will include all 12 factions from the original tabletop game and its expansion Armada it is based on: the Imperial Navy, Space Marines, Adeptus Mechanicus, Necrons, Chaos, Aeldari Corsairs, Aeldari Craftworld, Drukhari, the T’au Merchant and Protector Fleets, Orks, and finally, the Tyranids.

The latest dramatic story development in the Warhammer 40,000 universe, the Gathering Storm and the 13th Black Crusade, will serve as the canvas for several extensive and dynamic campaigns.

With bigger battles, refined gameplay, improved multiplayer modes and features for a better and more balanced online experience, and even more customization options for fleets and ships, Battlefleet Gothic: Armada 2 promises to be the ultimate Warhammer 40,000 space battle experience.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/battlefleet-gothic-armada-2', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, 7.6, 0, 1.38880000000000016e+01, '2026-11-23 15:29:50', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
