VALUES (NULL, NULL, 545, 'Call of Duty: Black Ops', 'Call of Duty: Black Ops', 'game', 2010, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wkl.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar69al.jpg', 'Call of Duty: Black Ops is the seventh main Call of Duty game and the sequel to Call of Duty: World at War. The game differs from most previous installments, which would involve a usual three-country campaign, while Call of Duty: Black Ops features two playable countries (Russia and the USA) but only has an American campaign. Several new features are also introduced, such as dive-to-prone and the available use of a flashlight on certain weapons. Furthermore, the campaign''s playable characters now speak while being controlled by the player.

Extra game included within:

+ Zork (Apple II)', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/call-of-duty-black-ops', '["PlayStation 3", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Mac", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 8.0, 0, 6.17666666666666675e+00, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
