VALUES (NULL, NULL, 6632, 'Call of Duty: Advanced Warfare', 'Call of Duty: Advanced Warfare', 'game', 2014, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wky.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arnpw.jpg', 'Call of Duty: Advanced Warfare is a first-person shooter with single-player and multiplayer modes. It is set in a near future where powered exoskeletons give soldiers enhanced mobility such as boosting, dashing, and jumping, alongside conventional and directed-energy weapons. The campaign follows a single protagonist through a cinematic story, while multiplayer and a wave-based cooperative survival mode build on the exoskeleton movement and a loadout customization system.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/call-of-duty-advanced-warfare', '["PlayStation 3", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox 360", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 7.6, 0, 7.5, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
