VALUES (NULL, NULL, 18968, 'Call of Duty: Infinite Warfare', 'Call of Duty: Infinite Warfare', 'game', 2016, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1wkp.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arn2p.jpg', 'Call of Duty: Infinite Warfare delivers three unique game modes: Campaign, Multiplayer, and Zombies. Campaign is a return to the gritty, military roots of the franchise, while boldly looking ahead, delivering a rich and engaging narrative that is unlike anything to date in a Call of Duty game. The player will embark on a classically-styled story about grand scale warfare, set in a future where human conflict has spread throughout our solar system.

Multiplayer combines popular mechanics such as the chained-based movement system, with a load of gameplay innovations to deliver one of the deepest and most engaging online experiences in gaming. The new Zombies mode will thrill co-op players with an original, distinctive approach and an uproarious narrative sure to excite fans. The title introduces stunning, multi-planetary environments, new weaponry, and all-new player abilities.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/call-of-duty-infinite-warfare', '["PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 7.4, 0, 11.725, '2026-11-27 20:45:57', '2026-11-28 04:52:47')
